  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "$\\begin{array}{lll}\n\\text { Case I } & 5 \\ldots \\ldots & 0 \\\\\n\\text { Case II } & 5 \\ldots \\ldots & \\\\\n& 5 & 1 \\\\\n& 5 & 3 \\\\\n& 6 & 0 \\\\\n& 6 & 1 \\\\\n& 6 & 2 \\\\\n& 7 & 0 \\\\\n& 7 & 1\n\\end{array}$\n\n$9 \\times(8 \\times 8 \\times 8)=4608$ but 50000 is not included, so total numbers $4608-1=4607$",
